<title>USA: Claire's Stores Inc Q3 shr increases.</title>
<headline>Claire's Stores Inc Q3 shr increases.</headline>
<dateline>PEMBROKE PINES, Fla. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In 000s except per share data and stores)</p>
<p>						 THREE MONTHS ENDED</p>
<p>					  Nov 2, 1996	Oct 28, 1995</p>
<p> Net Sales				 $102,634	     $79,842</p>
<p> Net Income				   7,578		 5,016</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share			   .16		   .11</p>
